{title: 010 - Come, Christians, Join to Sing}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #010 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: A}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 10}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A]Come, [E]Chris[A]tians, [D]join to [A]sing, Alle[D]luia! [A]A [E7][A]men!
[A]Loud [E]praise [A]to [D]Christ our [A]King; Alle[D]luia! [A]A [E7][A]men!
[A]Let [E7]all, [A]with [D]heart [A]and [E]voice, [A]Be[E]fore [A]His [Bm]throne [A]re[E]joice;
[A]Praise [E]is [A]His [D]gracious [E]choice; [A]Alle[Bm]luia! [A]A [E7][A]men!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A][E]Come, [A]lift [D][A]your [D]hearts [A][E7]on [A]high;
[A][E][A][D][A]Alleluia! [D][A][E7][A]Amen!
[A][E7][A]Let [D][A]praises [E][A][E]fill [A][Bm]the [A][E]sky;
[A][E][A][D][E]Alleluia! [A][Bm][A][E7][A]Amen!
[A][E]He [A]is [D][A]our [D]Guide [A][E7]and [A]Friend;
[A][E][A]To [D][A]us [D][A]He'll [E7][A]condescend;
[A][E7][A]His [D][A]love [E][A][E]shall [A][Bm]never [A][E]end:
[A][E][A][D][E]Alleluia! [A][Bm][A][E7][A]Amen!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[A][E]Praise [A][D]yet [A][D]our [A][E7]Christ [A]again;
[A][E][A][D][A]Alleluia! [D][A][E7][A]Amen!
[A][E7]Life [A][D]shall [A][E]not [A][E]end [A][Bm]the [A][E]strain;
[A][E][A][D][E]Alleluia! [A][Bm][A][E7][A]Amen!
[A][E][A]On [D][A]heaven's [D][A]blissful [E7][A]shore
[A][E][A]His [D][A]goodness [D][A]we'll [E7][A]adore,
[A][E7][A][D][A][E]Singing [A][E][A][Bm][A][E]forevermore,
[A][E][A][D][E]Alleluia! [A][Bm][A][E7][A]Amen!
{end_of_verse}
